---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
File an email as a record yourself

Usage: mxr records file [OPTIONS] <MESSAGE_ID>

Arguments:
  <MESSAGE_ID>

Options:
      --kind <KIND>        receipt, order, booking, invoice, statement, ticket, contract, warranty or account; the detector's reading otherwise
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
